msgid "ReliefOS 5.1.2"
msgstr "ReliefOS 5.1.2"

msgid "更新内容"
msgstr "Changes"

msgid "应用与桌面"
msgstr "Applications and desktop"

msgid ""
"新增 **ReliefDiagram** 思维导图、流程图和逻辑关系图编辑器，提供图形与连线、分支折叠、布局排列、多选、属性编辑、撤销重做和模板。原生 ``.rdiagram`` "
"文档保留编辑状态，支持 SVG、PNG、Markdown 导出，文件读写和原子保存由后台进程处理。"
msgstr ""
"Added **ReliefDiagram**, a mind-map, flowchart, and logical-relationship editor, with "
"shapes/connectors, branch folding, layout, multiselection, properties, undo/redo, and templates. "
"Native ``.rdiagram`` documents preserve editing state; SVG, PNG, and Markdown export are "
"supported. Background processes handle file I/O and atomic saves."

msgid ""
"新增 **ReliefPlayer** 本地 MP3/WAV "
"播放器，支持播放暂停、停止、定位、前后跳转、音量和静音。解码、读取和音频输出在独立进程执行，界面显示格式与播放进度，并明确报告设备占用和输出失败。"
msgstr ""
"Added **ReliefPlayer**, a local MP3/WAV player with play/pause, stop, seeking, forward/backward "
"jumps, volume, and mute. Separate processes handle decoding, reads, and audio output. The UI shows"
" format/progress and explicitly reports busy devices and output failures."

msgid ""
"新增 **ReliefCapture** 截图与标注工具，支持区域、窗口、全屏和延时截图，提供画笔、箭头、矩形、中文文字、撤销重做、X11 图像剪贴板及 PNG 保存。IceWM 默认增加 "
"**Win+Shift+S** 选区快捷键。"
msgstr ""
"Added **ReliefCapture** for screenshots/annotation: region, window, full-screen, and delayed "
"capture, with pens, arrows, rectangles, Chinese text, undo/redo, X11 image clipboard, and PNG "
"saves. IceWM adds the default **Win+Shift+S** region-selection shortcut."

msgid "计算器扩展为标准、科学、程序员、单位换算、统计和日期六种模式，增加精确整数位运算与位编辑器、18 类 145 个单位、会话历史、内存和快捷键；各模式保留独立输入。"
msgstr ""
"The calculator expands to six modes: standard, scientific, programmer, unit conversion, "
"statistics, and dates. Adds exact-integer bit operations, a bit editor, 145 units in 18 "
"categories, session history, memory, and shortcuts; each mode retains its own input."

msgid ""
"**Diskmgr** 从 旧图形前端迁移到原生 C++/FLTK/X11。保留 GPT 分区查看、新建、格式化、删除及挂载管理，增加中文 GPT 名称、异步操作、普通用户只读界面和 sudo "
"管理员窗口。破坏性操作重新核对设备与分区身份，使用明确确认，并报告部分成功。"
msgstr ""
"**Diskmgr** migrates from the old graphical frontend to native C++/FLTK/X11. Retains GPT viewing, "
"creation, formatting, deletion, and mount management, adding Chinese GPT names, asynchronous "
"operations, a read-only normal-user UI, and sudo administrator windows. Destructive operations "
"recheck device/partition identity, require explicit confirmation, and report partial success."

msgid ""
"修复 **ReliefMail** 将部分 CA 解析成功误判为整库失败的问题；连接继续校验域名、有效期和证书链。通过 ReliefAPK 提供证书恢复、备份和签名包更新流程，同步维护 CA "
"源包与汇总包，处理 ``.apk-new``、旧版本约束和 apk 跳过修复等情况。"
msgstr ""
"Fixed **ReliefMail** treating partial CA parsing success as failure of the entire store. "
"Connections still verify hostname, validity, and certificate chain. ReliefAPK provides certificate"
" recovery, backups, and signed-package updates, maintaining CA source/bundle packages together and"
" handling ``.apk-new``, old version constraints, and apk skipping repair."

msgid "为新增应用接入中文翻译、图标、desktop 入口、组件选择和包归属，并增加适用的 MIME、文件管理器关联及菜单分组。"
msgstr ""
"New applications integrate Chinese translations, icons, desktop entries, component selection, and "
"package ownership, plus applicable MIME declarations, file-manager associations, and menu groups."

msgid "构建、安装与启动介质"
msgstr "Builds, installation, and boot media"

msgid ""
"自研运行库、应用和宿主工具改用固定的 **Linux 6.12 "
"Kbuild/Kconfig**，按目录登记对象、跟踪命令和头文件依赖；移除旧自研编译规则与配置前端。第三方项目继续使用其原生构建系统，顶层 Make 继续集成 "
"SDK、APK、镜像、测试和运行目标。"
msgstr ""
"In-house runtimes, applications, and host tools move to pinned **Linux 6.12 Kbuild/Kconfig**, "
"registering objects per directory and tracking command/header dependencies. Old custom compilation"
" rules and configuration frontends are removed. Third-party projects retain native build systems; "
"top-level Make still integrates SDK, APK, images, tests, and run targets."

msgid ""
"Installer ISO、Live ISO、VMDK 默认同时支持 **Legacy BIOS 与 UEFI**，原有产物文件名保留。两平台 GNU GRUB 2.12 "
"从锁定源码构建，替换旧预编译 EFI 树。"
msgstr ""
"Installer ISO, Live ISO, and VMDK support both **Legacy BIOS and UEFI** by default, preserving "
"artifact filenames. GNU GRUB 2.12 for both platforms is built from locked source, replacing the "
"old prebuilt EFI tree."

msgid ""
"GUI、TTY 和 CLI 安装流程共用引导校验与发布逻辑；新安装默认安装 BIOS 和 UEFI 引导器，可独立取消任一或两者。默认 GPT 包含 BIOS Boot、ESP 和 "
"root，菜单以 GPT PARTUUID 绑定目标根分区；旧 UEFI 布局更新保留原有分区。"
msgstr ""
"GUI, TTY, and CLI installation share boot validation/publication logic. New installs default to "
"both BIOS and UEFI loaders, allowing either or both to be deselected. Default GPT contains BIOS "
"Boot, ESP, and root; menus bind root by GPT PARTUUID. Updates of old UEFI layouts preserve "
"partitions."

msgid ""
"安装前检查容量、inode、分区角色及载荷，失败时保留阶段诊断；优化小文件复制的进度更新与新 root 的整体同步，减少安装滚屏及重复 journal 提交。引导资源和菜单按阶段发布，不将多文件或"
" BIOS 写入宣称为整体断电原子事务。"
msgstr ""
"Preinstallation checks cover capacity, inodes, partition roles, and payloads, retaining stage "
"diagnostics on failure. Optimized small-file copy progress and whole-new-root synchronization "
"reduce scrolling and repeated journal commits. Boot resources/menus publish in stages; multi-file "
"or BIOS writes are not claimed as a single power-loss-atomic transaction."

msgid "开发与验证"
msgstr "Development and validation"

msgid "更新主仓对模块化内核的源码路径、SDK/头文件边界及测试适配，增加构建输入审计并修复 CI 对完整内核源码的集成。"
msgstr ""
"Updated modular-kernel source paths, SDK/header boundaries, and test integration in this "
"repository; added build-input audits and fixed CI integration of full kernel sources."

msgid ""
"增加应用、中文 GPT、双固件介质和实际安装、启动徽标、文字 panic 覆盖、POSIX I/O、SMP 计时、Linux exec 容量及描述符时间戳的定向回归和运行工具；内核实现详见独立的 "
"ReliefNT 5.1.2 Release。"
msgstr ""
"Added targeted regressions/runtime tools for applications, Chinese GPT, dual-firmware media and "
"real installation, boot logos, text-panic overlays, POSIX I/O, SMP timing, Linux exec capacity, "
"and descriptor timestamps. Kernel implementations are in the separate ReliefNT 5.1.2 Release."

msgid "更新构建、安装、驱动与验证文档，并按完整版本提交区间独立归档两仓发布说明。"
msgstr ""
"Updated build, installation, driver, and validation documentation, independently archiving both "
"repositories' release notes over complete version-commit ranges."

msgid "破坏性更新"
msgstr "Breaking changes"

msgid "**是，涉及构建配置、引导布局及部分管理工作流。**"
msgstr "**Yes: build configuration, boot layout, and some administration workflows.**"

msgid "构建配置移到 ``O/.config``；旧 ``mk/`` 规则、配置前端和旧源码路径不再是生产入口。调用这些内部路径的脚本需要迁移。"
msgstr ""
"Build configuration moves to ``O/.config``. Old ``mk/`` rules, configuration frontends, and source"
" paths are no longer production entry points; scripts calling them need migration."

msgid "默认新磁盘增加未格式化的 BIOS Boot 分区；硬编码旧两分区编号或旧预编译 EFI 路径的工具需调整。旧 UEFI 盘不会自动腾挪空间补装 BIOS 引导器。"
msgstr ""
"Default new disks add an unformatted BIOS Boot partition. Tools hardcoding old two-partition "
"numbers or prebuilt EFI paths need adjustment. Old UEFI disks are not automatically rearranged to "
"add BIOS loaders."

msgid "Diskmgr 需要 X11/FLTK；依赖旧图形界面的启动方式需更新。普通用户修改磁盘需有相应 sudo 授权，不能依赖旧桌面角色隐式获得写权限。"
msgstr ""
"Diskmgr requires X11/FLTK; launch methods tied to the old UI need updates. Normal-user disk "
"changes need corresponding sudo authorization, not implicit write access from old desktop roles."

msgid ""
"系统信任包将 ``/etc/ssl/certs`` 视为生成的证书输出目录；自定义 apk 保护规则和 CA 部署需人工合并。证书修复会刷新两个 CA "
"包的旧精确版本或仓库标签约束，执行前应审阅计划。"
msgstr ""
"System trust packages treat ``/etc/ssl/certs`` as generated certificate output. Merge custom apk "
"protection rules and CA deployments manually. Certificate repair refreshes old exact-"
"version/repository-tag constraints for both CA packages; review the plan before execution."

msgid "更新与迁移注意事项"
msgstr "Update and migration notes"

msgid ""
"本次为 **源码 Release**，提供标签与 GitHub 自动源码归档，不附带预编译系统镜像。请递归初始化子模块并使用标签固定的 ReliefNT 提交；GitHub ZIP/TAR.GZ "
"不展开子模块。"
msgstr ""
"This is a **source release**, providing a tag and GitHub automatic source archives without "
"prebuilt system images. Recursively initialize submodules at the tag's pinned ReliefNT commit; "
"GitHub ZIP/TAR.GZ does not expand submodules."

msgid ""
"备份文档、邮件与账户资料、CA、自定义桌面配置和分区数据。在新的 ``O`` 目录重建；沿用旧配置时，将旧 ``config/.config`` 复制为新 ``O/.config``，再执行 "
"``make O=新目录 olddefconfig``。常用镜像仍位于 ``O/images/``。"
msgstr ""
"Back up documents, mail/account data, CAs, custom desktop configuration, and partition data. "
"Rebuild in a new ``O`` directory. To reuse configuration, copy old ``config/.config`` to new "
"``O/.config``, then run ``make O=新目录 olddefconfig``. Common images remain in ``O/images/``."

msgid ""
"新安装默认双引导；两种引导器都不选时，不会得到可直接启动的 BIOS/EFI loader。旧 UEFI 盘缺少 BIOS Boot 空间时，补装 BIOS 应在擦写前失败，勿把 ESP 直接改作"
" BIOS Boot。旧内核可能不识别 PARTUUID，回滚需按安装文档处理。"
msgstr ""
"New installs default to dual boot; deselecting both yields no directly bootable BIOS/EFI loader. "
"If an old UEFI disk lacks BIOS Boot space, adding BIOS must fail before erasing/writing; do not "
"repurpose ESP as BIOS Boot. Older kernels may not recognize PARTUUID; follow installation "
"documentation for rollback."

msgid ""
"ISO 是双 El Torito 光盘镜像，本版没有承诺可直接写入 U 盘作为 hybrid 镜像。证书修复应同步更新 ReliefMail、ReliefAPK "
"和系统信任包，保留管理员的自定义信任策略。"
msgstr ""
"The ISO is a dual El Torito optical image; this release does not promise a hybrid image directly "
"writable to USB. Certificate repair should update ReliefMail, ReliefAPK, and system trust packages"
" together, preserving administrator trust policy."

msgid ""
"ReliefCapture 的剪贴板内容由其进程提供，粘贴前需保持程序运行；窗口截图保留实际遮挡。ReliefPlayer 首版仅播放单个本地文件；ReliefDiagram "
"原生格式不承诺其他厂商格式兼容。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefCapture serves clipboard contents from its process; keep it running until paste. Window "
"captures preserve actual occlusion. Initial ReliefPlayer plays one local file only; ReliefDiagram "
"native formats do not promise compatibility with other vendors."

msgid ""
"分项构建与 QEMU 验收记录见各应用及 `双启动验证文档 "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.2/docs/build/dual-"
"boot-2026-10-22.md>`_，不能视为本标签所有组合的整版验收。**VMware 验证未完成**，物理硬件未验证。"
msgstr ""
"For individual build/QEMU records, see each application and the `dual-boot validation document "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.2/docs/build/dual-boot-2026-10-22.md>`_. "
"These are not full-release acceptance for all tag combinations. **VMware validation is "
"incomplete**; physical hardware is unverified."

msgid ""
"保留已知限制：默认 OVMF 高地址 NVMe BAR 超出现有 direct map 支持范围；硬关机后 Xorg 锁文件可能阻止恢复；编译压力下 IceWM 拖动问题仍未完成验证。上一版记录的"
" ReliefMath 关窗崩溃在本区间没有修复或完成复验。"
msgstr ""
"Known limits remain: default OVMF high-address NVMe BARs exceed current direct-map support; Xorg "
"lock files can block recovery after hard power-off; IceWM dragging under compilation pressure "
"remains incompletely validated. The prior ReliefMath close crash was neither fixed nor fully "
"retested in this range."

msgid ""
"公开总测试仍有既有 ``soundctl`` 包归属失败，另有音频策略/产物、部分旧 fixture 和 ABI golden 差异；本次未改变这些策略或重生成 golden，不宣称全套测试通过。"
msgstr ""
"Public aggregate tests retain an existing ``soundctl`` ownership failure, audio-policy/artifact "
"issues, old fixtures, and ABI golden differences. These policies and golden data were not changed;"
" no full-suite pass is claimed."

msgid "开发者提示"
msgstr "Developer notes"

msgid ""
"基础版本为 ``5.1.2``，``configs/build-version`` 与 ``/etc/os-release`` 的 ``VERSION_ID`` "
"一致；内核版本由其自身配置生成，后缀仍使用 ``EXTRAVERSION``/``LOCALVERSION``。"
msgstr ""
"Base version is ``5.1.2``; ``configs/build-version`` matches ``VERSION_ID`` in ``/etc/os-"
"release``. Kernel versions come from kernel configuration, with ``EXTRAVERSION``/``LOCALVERSION`` "
"suffixes unchanged."

msgid ""
"生产入口继续是根 GNU Make；使用 ``defconfig``、``olddefconfig``、``menuconfig`` 和各目录 Kbuild。需 GNU Make 4.3 "
"或更新版本，目标工具链和第三方输入仍以仓库配置、锁文件为准。"
msgstr ""
"Root GNU Make remains the production entry; use ``defconfig``, ``olddefconfig``, ``menuconfig``, "
"and per-directory Kbuild. GNU Make 4.3+ is required; repository configuration/locks still define "
"target toolchains and third-party inputs."

msgid ""
"构建新增 GUI 应用时使用目标 musl、C++17、FLTK 及系统中文字体，保持中央 FLTK 清单、组件、包归属、图标和安装器裁剪一致。自定义磁盘工具还应阅读 ReliefNT 的 "
"``BLKROGET`` 编码和能力权限迁移说明。"
msgstr ""
"Build new GUI applications with target musl, C++17, FLTK, and system Chinese fonts, keeping the "
"central FLTK list, components, ownership, icons, and installer trimming consistent. Custom disk "
"tools should also read ReliefNT's ``BLKROGET`` encoding/capability-permission migration notes."

msgid ""
"``make run QEMU_BOOT=bios`` 选择 SeaBIOS，默认 ``QEMU_BOOT=uefi`` 使用 OVMF；``test-smoke`` "
"顺序检查三类介质的两种固件启动，不能替代实际安装和升级验收。"
msgstr ""
"``make run QEMU_BOOT=bios`` selects SeaBIOS; default ``QEMU_BOOT=uefi`` uses OVMF. ``test-smoke`` "
"sequentially checks both firmware boots for three media types and does not replace actual "
"installation/upgrade acceptance."

msgid ""
"本说明覆盖主仓 5.1.1 版本提交 ``10e76d319ec9ca4375d6faf9555d64f18fb80e69`` 之后至本标签的有效变更，排除纯 gitlink "
"同步和内核实现。下一版以本次版本提交为区间起点。"
msgstr ""
"These notes cover effective repository changes after the 5.1.1 version commit "
"``10e76d319ec9ca4375d6faf9555d64f18fb80e69`` through this tag, excluding gitlink-only "
"synchronization and kernel implementations. The next range starts at this version commit."
